abstract: >-
  ARS-Codex is the Codex-native sibling of Academic Research Skills
  (ARS) for Claude Code. It packages the ARS workflows as one Codex
  skill for research scoping, literature and systematic reviews,
  study screening, paper writing, manuscript review, citation and
  integrity checks, and experiment planning, for noncommercial
  scholarly use.
